  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>Na</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Ca</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>Ca</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>1 mol calcium ion reacts with 2 moles of resin</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>resin</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>412</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>g</mo><mi>resin</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mo>Ca</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi>ions</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mo>Ca</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>ions</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Moles</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mo>Ca</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;per&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>resin</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>412</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
